# Jetpack Compose: Modern Android UI Development

Jetpack Compose is Android's modern toolkit for building native UI. It simplifies and accelerates UI development with less code, powerful tools, and intuitive Kotlin APIs.

## Why Jetpack Compose?

- **Declarative**: Describe what UI should look like
- **Less Code**: No XML layouts, no findViewById
- **Kotlin-First**: Full Kotlin language features
- **Powerful**: Built-in animations, theming
- **Interoperable**: Works with existing Views

## Composable Functions

### Basic Composable

```kotlin
import androidx.compose.material3.*
import androidx.compose.runtime.*
import androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*

@Composable
fun Greeting(name: String) {
    Text(
        text = "Hello, $name!",
        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium
    )
}

// Usage
@Composable
fun MyApp() {
    Greeting(name = "Android")
}
```

### Composable with Modifiers

```kotlin
@Composable
fun StyledGreeting(name: String) {
    Text(
        text = "Hello, $name!",
        modifier = Modifier
            .padding(16.dp)
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .background(Color.LightGray)
            .clickable { /* handle click */ },
        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium,
        color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
    )
}
```

## Layout Composables

### Column and Row

```kotlin
@Composable
fun UserProfile() {
    Column(
        modifier = Modifier
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .padding(16.dp),
        verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)
    ) {
        Row(
            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically,
            horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp)
        ) {
            ProfileImage()
            Column {
                Text("John Doe", style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)
                Text("@johndoe", style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall)
            }
        }
        Text("Software Developer | Android Enthusiast")
        Row(horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {
            Button(onClick = { }) { Text("Follow") }
            OutlinedButton(onClick = { }) { Text("Message") }
        }
    }
}
```

### Box (Stack)

```kotlin
@Composable
fun ImageWithBadge() {
